      "role": "user",
      "content": "got it. one more thing, i was reading online that sometimes weird patterns or patches in the grass can mean something else is going on, like pests or soil issues. is there anything else that could cause those same yellow/brown patches besides just the nutrients being low?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
